WEBVTT

00:02.030 --> 00:03.140
Your Majesty,

00:03.730 --> 00:07.060
we're ready to send our forces 
to the demonic continent.

00:07.410 --> 00:10.570
Good. Send aid immediately.

00:11.100 --> 00:12.110
Hurry.

00:12.110 --> 00:12.730
At once!

00:14.290 --> 00:17.730
What will happen to Eclaire?

00:17.730 --> 00:20.220
If another war were to break out...

00:22.000 --> 00:25.960
Setsu is already on his way.
He'll take care of it.

00:26.480 --> 00:28.000
That's who he is.

01:59.180 --> 02:04.010
<b><i>Episode 11</i></b>

01:59.180 --> 02:04.010
<b><i>Going All-In for a Second Time</i></b>

02:09.330 --> 02:10.940
This magic power...

02:23.240 --> 02:24.830
You're safe now.

02:25.460 --> 02:27.750
Setsu-sama!

02:26.580 --> 02:27.750
Yuki-kun!

02:27.750 --> 02:30.170
Yuki-kun! Yuki-kun! Yuki-kun!

02:30.960 --> 02:32.330
I missed you!

02:30.960 --> 02:32.330
Stop, stop!

02:32.840 --> 02:34.310
Calm down!

02:35.340 --> 02:39.400
Oh, s-s-sorry! I got carried away!

02:39.400 --> 02:40.930
Nah, it's fine.

02:41.490 --> 02:44.260
Sorry to make you wait.

02:45.550 --> 02:46.770
It's okay!

02:47.450 --> 02:48.960
Oh, by the way,

02:49.610 --> 02:53.360
about my training with Master Elka...

02:53.360 --> 02:53.980
Huh?

02:55.450 --> 03:00.720
I'm sorry! I can't do it as well as Master Elka,

03:00.720 --> 03:01.860
but please, have a seat!

03:03.080 --> 03:04.280
Elka...

03:04.870 --> 03:07.560
I don't need another masochist character.

03:07.560 --> 03:08.290
Ow!

03:08.750 --> 03:11.180
We'll discuss this later.

03:11.180 --> 03:13.450
Stand back with Elka and the others.

03:13.450 --> 03:15.430
Be careful, Yuki-kun.

03:15.430 --> 03:17.100
Yeah, I've got this.

03:21.110 --> 03:23.550
Sorry to make you wait.

03:23.550 --> 03:28.140
Setsu the Hero. I've wanted to fight you again.

03:32.480 --> 03:35.770
That magic power... You're the 
guy who was at Dezas's place.

03:39.400 --> 03:42.290
I'm honored that you remember me.

03:42.290 --> 03:45.130
However, I am different from that time.

03:46.220 --> 03:48.300
It doesn't seem like you're all talk.

03:56.640 --> 04:00.130
Why do you care about the weak?

04:00.130 --> 04:01.470
What do you mean?

04:01.810 --> 04:06.270
From your point of view, those people 
behind you must be like insects.

04:06.270 --> 04:10.890
Does it please you to be the strong 
one caring for the weaklings?

04:11.300 --> 04:15.680
Huh? I don't care about crap 
like strength or pleasure.

04:15.680 --> 04:19.190
They're precious to me,
so I protect them. That's all.

04:19.190 --> 04:23.730
Being able to enforce your will... I suppose 
that's a privilege given to the strong.

04:24.870 --> 04:27.620
This world does indeed need to be destroyed.

04:27.870 --> 04:31.910
Hah! I'll just protect this 
world because I want to!

04:44.630 --> 04:47.930
None of you will be getting away!
Not a single one!

04:58.190 --> 05:00.740
Looks like we got lucky, Big Sis.

05:00.740 --> 05:04.190
Yes. Good to see you again, Big Sister Kuroinu.

05:04.640 --> 05:05.800
You!

05:06.340 --> 05:07.280
We know...

05:07.730 --> 05:11.240
that you're not a bad person.

05:11.240 --> 05:16.170
So I think if you can just tell us what's 
going on, there'll be no need to fight.

05:18.580 --> 05:20.750
"Big Sister" this, "Big Sister" that!

05:20.750 --> 05:26.090
Your idiotic pretend-sisterhood 
makes me sick to my stomach!

05:30.300 --> 05:33.390
So we have no choice but to fight?

05:33.390 --> 05:36.630
If you really think of me as your big sister,

05:36.630 --> 05:39.520
you'll both die without resisting.

05:40.220 --> 05:42.400
Big Sister Kuroinu...

05:44.020 --> 05:48.200
I will protect my big sis 
from anyone, no matter who.

05:48.450 --> 05:51.920
Oh, the younger sister seems 
much more cold-hearted.

05:51.920 --> 05:57.360
I'm sorry. As a big sister myself,
I must protect Mineko.

05:58.140 --> 06:02.750
Hah! Then I'll shred you 
and your stupid sisterhood!

06:15.890 --> 06:18.360
That's the best you can both do?

06:18.360 --> 06:21.860
I'm so glad I got rid of you useless cats!

06:25.400 --> 06:26.490
Mineko!

06:26.750 --> 06:28.070
Yes, Big Sis!

06:28.070 --> 06:30.610
Mineko, follow my lead!

06:32.830 --> 06:35.200
I'm sorry, Big Sister Kuroinu!

06:44.210 --> 06:46.420
It's over.

06:46.860 --> 06:49.450
It's meaningless to keep fighting.

06:50.600 --> 06:53.760
What's meaningless?

07:03.190 --> 07:05.450
You filthy cats...

07:05.450 --> 07:07.640
I'll punish you for your insolence!

07:12.550 --> 07:15.290
Yeah, yeah, how wonderful your love is!

07:15.290 --> 07:16.950
I'm going to puke!

07:17.220 --> 07:20.040
I can't watch this phony sisterhood anymore!

07:20.320 --> 07:23.960
I'll kill you both at the 
same time, so thank me!

07:24.350 --> 07:26.220
Limit Break!

07:34.160 --> 07:37.180
Goodbye, filthy cats!

07:42.510 --> 07:43.420
So fast!

07:44.320 --> 07:45.830
Big Sis!

07:49.360 --> 07:51.360
See? That's reality.

07:51.360 --> 07:54.360
Sisterhood has no real value.

07:54.360 --> 07:56.580
It's just a curse.

07:56.840 --> 08:00.750
You'll never understand why my big 
sister wants to call you "Big Sister"!

08:01.090 --> 08:06.710
Oh, I understand that it's 
a worthless, idiotic curse.

08:07.600 --> 08:10.460
Big Sister Kuroinu...

08:10.730 --> 08:13.340
The only one who thinks that's a curse...

08:13.740 --> 08:16.550
is you, Big Sister Kuroinu!

08:17.330 --> 08:21.850
You don't know anything.
How dare you speak to me that way?

08:22.120 --> 08:24.230
Just die already!

08:28.030 --> 08:29.070
Mineko!

08:29.360 --> 08:30.230
Big Sis!

08:34.970 --> 08:36.660
Beast Merge!

08:37.070 --> 08:38.030
Wha—

08:48.380 --> 08:51.090
This is our secret power.

08:51.320 --> 08:54.050
That's your secret power?

08:54.700 --> 08:57.190
Two useless strays mashed together are stil—

08:58.310 --> 09:00.010
You can tell.

09:00.720 --> 09:02.640
You don't have a chance against us.

09:04.800 --> 09:06.840
Your ears... You're afraid.

09:10.190 --> 09:13.360
Enough!

09:14.400 --> 09:15.400
I am...

09:15.730 --> 09:17.410
I am...

09:19.800 --> 09:21.540
Wind Beast!

09:35.230 --> 09:38.260
We destroyed all of the arms on your back.

09:38.260 --> 09:39.970
You can't fight anymore.

09:43.670 --> 09:46.600
Shut... up...

09:47.040 --> 09:49.900
If I give up now...

09:52.040 --> 09:53.860
how will I...

09:53.860 --> 09:55.710
ever be able...

09:57.170 --> 10:00.470
to face them?!

10:11.430 --> 10:14.550
It's revolting...

10:15.750 --> 10:18.180
Sisters who are so close...

10:18.440 --> 10:22.050
Big Sister Kuroinu, did you have sisters, too?

10:22.360 --> 10:26.100
Who knows?

10:34.110 --> 10:37.830
Let's go, Mineko. This battle isn't over yet.

10:37.830 --> 10:39.590
Yes, you're right.

10:48.510 --> 10:51.210
There's only one enemy! Finish this!

10:57.600 --> 10:58.550
What?!

11:02.340 --> 11:05.810
That was a good charge, but...

11:06.310 --> 11:08.270
Still not enough!

11:12.150 --> 11:14.420
Come at me harder!

11:14.420 --> 11:21.240
I, Virdos, invite you to attack me 
hard enough to shake me to my core!

11:21.980 --> 11:23.190
What the... How...

11:24.200 --> 11:25.080
What's that?!

11:33.550 --> 11:37.670
Ow! How are you so hard?!

11:40.390 --> 11:43.040
R-Roa Leonaire-sama?!

11:43.040 --> 11:45.090
Zoo Dorado sent me to assist you.

11:43.040 --> 11:45.090
Reinforcements?

11:45.090 --> 11:48.310
I've got this. You can back off now.

11:46.020 --> 11:47.640
What a relief!

11:48.620 --> 11:50.700
Thank you! We owe you!

11:50.700 --> 11:55.820
Oh, I thought it was quite rude 
how you suddenly punched me.

11:55.820 --> 11:58.180
So you're actually the Beast King's daughter?

11:58.180 --> 12:01.120
No wonder you feel good!

12:01.710 --> 12:06.990
But that little kitty punch wasn't 
the best you had, was it, kitten?

12:08.530 --> 12:13.120
You're as tough as iron, so I guess you 
don't just have regular muscle mass.

12:14.150 --> 12:17.750
Correct! You really can tell what's 
special about this sexy body!

12:18.060 --> 12:21.380
You're actually made of iron? What a freak.

12:21.380 --> 12:26.720
True. But I was created by humans.

12:26.980 --> 12:33.810
I endured torturous experiments from
a very young age, over and over again.

12:33.810 --> 12:35.520
"Created"?

12:35.520 --> 12:40.570
That said, it did give me this strength,

12:40.570 --> 12:44.450
and that was how I got
Toma-sama to rescue me.

12:44.450 --> 12:46.290
So you could say it worked out.

12:46.290 --> 12:47.530
Shut up!

12:47.830 --> 12:52.310
Toma is the one trying to destroy 
the whole world based on a delusion!

12:52.310 --> 12:54.390
And what's wrong with that?

12:54.920 --> 12:58.530
The strong get what they want.

12:58.530 --> 13:02.130
Same goes for those who played with my body.

13:03.340 --> 13:06.720
Same goes for that guy, too... 
What was his name? Rouga?

13:06.720 --> 13:09.310
He was one of yours, right?

13:15.200 --> 13:19.980
Attacking in the middle of 
our chat? What a brute.

13:20.350 --> 13:21.610
Shut up!

13:22.550 --> 13:25.400
Don't talk about him like 
you know anything about him.

13:25.400 --> 13:30.370
That stuff about torture and experiments 
made you sound like someone I should pity,

13:30.660 --> 13:34.250
but now I know you've been 
messed with in the head, too!

13:34.700 --> 13:38.120
I am Roa Leonaire,
daughter of the Beast King!

13:38.360 --> 13:41.440
For toying with the pride of 
the Beastmen, I will crush you!

13:42.360 --> 13:47.800
Iron, steel... Whatever you are,
I just have to keep hitting until you break!

13:48.050 --> 13:51.310
Ugh, idiots are so cute.

13:51.310 --> 13:53.560
I don't need your compassion, anyway.

13:53.850 --> 13:56.800
I'm done. I'll kill you now!

14:01.040 --> 14:02.230
What?!

14:02.600 --> 14:06.920
Did you think my iron body was my only power?

14:06.920 --> 14:11.240
My true power is the ability 
to control this body freely.

14:11.240 --> 14:12.960
Like this.

14:14.120 --> 14:17.500
Any shape or size!

14:32.010 --> 14:34.930
Come on! Keep moving!

14:37.310 --> 14:41.900
Oh, dead already? Maybe I went too hard.

14:42.190 --> 14:47.770
Having pride is meaningless in this world.

14:49.160 --> 14:50.410
Wait.

14:55.450 --> 14:58.790
You should be dead.

14:59.120 --> 15:03.880
There's nothing more important than having 
pride in protecting what's important!

15:04.400 --> 15:06.740
If I can protect that pride...

15:08.340 --> 15:12.510
I'm willing to risk my life!

15:30.330 --> 15:32.360
<i>I've heard the stories.</i>

15:32.360 --> 15:35.760
<i>Those of the Beast King's bloodline, 
moments before their deaths,</i>

15:35.760 --> 15:37.700
<i>burn their lives to take their 
enemies down with them!</i>

15:37.700 --> 15:40.160
Then bring it on!

15:40.710 --> 15:44.500
My body will crush you and your pride!

15:58.060 --> 16:03.400
My body will never lose to some 
brute who keeps talking about pride!

16:08.310 --> 16:10.020
I win.

16:15.980 --> 16:17.530
It can't be...

16:17.530 --> 16:20.290
It's over!

16:25.960 --> 16:30.840
A Beastman's pride is tougher than anything...

16:37.440 --> 16:39.370
What a fool you are.

16:58.060 --> 17:00.160
How did you...

17:00.830 --> 17:05.370
You're just such a straightforward fool. 
Watching you made me want to...

17:10.630 --> 17:15.320
Why is someone like you working with Toma?

17:15.320 --> 17:17.200
Let me ask you this.

17:17.200 --> 17:21.420
Who else would care for a freak like me?

17:22.410 --> 17:26.300
Only kidding. I just like hot guys.

17:27.060 --> 17:33.520
You and your foolish pride should live on.

17:36.480 --> 17:39.860
I'll carry your pride along with me.

17:49.680 --> 17:51.960
Your random strikes won't do any good!

17:52.360 --> 17:55.280
I wouldn't say they're random. Shadow Spike!

18:00.000 --> 18:02.550
You let your guard down, Setsu the Hero.

18:03.130 --> 18:05.100
I'll finish you!

18:07.520 --> 18:08.370
What?!

18:08.900 --> 18:11.770
Dude, don't underestimate me!

18:13.010 --> 18:14.610
What a nonsensical power!

18:14.610 --> 18:19.070
Surely you get it by now. You can't beat me.

18:19.500 --> 18:21.820
Just give up and call for Toma.

18:21.820 --> 18:24.450
I'm tired of playing with you.

18:30.160 --> 18:34.530
I will wager my life in this battle, as well.

18:36.960 --> 18:39.160
Limit Break.

18:52.060 --> 18:57.440
This is my true power, Skia Amur.

18:57.990 --> 19:00.840
A secret power used only in desperation, eh?

19:02.080 --> 19:05.810
If I can defeat you, I'm willing to risk my life.

19:06.920 --> 19:07.800
Here I come!

19:11.830 --> 19:13.420
Not yet!

19:23.940 --> 19:25.140
Meaningless!

19:25.140 --> 19:29.100
This shadow armor absorbs all energy!

19:29.470 --> 19:32.520
The sword of Setsu the Hero is no exception!

19:39.110 --> 19:41.710
You have no chance.

19:41.710 --> 19:43.070
I see.

19:44.370 --> 19:48.430
I'll just slash right through 
your precious armor, then!

20:03.130 --> 20:07.110
Flying Sword, Zetsu!

20:21.740 --> 20:24.160
You deflected the slash at the last moment.

20:25.190 --> 20:26.490
Not bad.

20:26.960 --> 20:29.690
Don't move. You really will die.

20:29.690 --> 20:32.250
Death is no issue!

20:33.200 --> 20:36.310
If I lose, I have no purpose!

20:36.790 --> 20:40.630
You live in the light. 
You'll never understand!

20:40.870 --> 20:43.360
We were created only to fight.

20:43.360 --> 20:46.720
There is no place for us to live!

20:47.040 --> 20:55.350
Thus, our only salvation is to resist this 
world until our last moments and perish!

21:00.650 --> 21:02.900
You idiot!

21:08.580 --> 21:12.310
I was able to fight my final battle 
without holding anything back.

21:12.750 --> 21:17.230
For that, I thank you, Setsu the Hero.

21:24.490 --> 21:26.280
They've all lost.

21:26.280 --> 21:29.220
Once again, you stand in my way, Setsu.

21:29.470 --> 21:32.430
But this time, it's really the finale.

21:32.430 --> 21:35.730
Let's close the curtain on this world.

21:47.600 --> 21:51.370
So you show yourself at last, final boss.

23:26.960 --> 23:31.970
<b><i>Next Time</i></b>

23:26.960 --> 23:31.970
<b><i>Fighting the Final Battle for a Second Time</i></b>

23:27.860 --> 23:30.860
Next time: "Fighting the 
Final Battle for a Second Time."
